  "body": "An architectural Arts & Crafts residence by renowned architect Basil Hooper, this beautifully upgraded Mission Bay home delivers timeless character with substantial contemporary enhancement.\r\n\r\nPositioned to capture a prized northeast aspect with a glimpse of Rangitoto, the home showcases native timber floors, panelled high-stud ceilings and elegant period glazing, all complemented by thoughtful modern improvements that elevate comfort and liveability.\r\n\r\nGenerous open-plan living flows to north-facing tiered decking and landscaped gardens with a private spa retreat, ideal for entertaining. The refined kitchen with stainless steel finishes is supported by a large scullery/laundry, while tiled bathrooms, central heating and excellent storage ensure effortless day-to-day living.\r\n\r\nWith garage, enclosed carport and zoning for Kohimarama School and Selwyn College, this is a move-in-ready coastal home in one of Auckland's most desirable bays, just moments from Tamaki Drive, the beach and vibrant village amenities.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
